DESCRIPTION:Join Paris Kern\, a student of Bobby McFerrin and Rhiannon\, f
 or a playful and inspiring exploration of group singing. Paris co-founded 
 VoiceExchange\, an improvisational vocal ensemble in the Washington\, D.C 
 area based on a program started by Bobby McFerrin. As McFerrin describes i
 t\, it’s like finding a language you’ve always known: a space to final
 ly express yourself\, surrounded by others doing the same. Explore your vo
 ice\, expand your rhythm and melody\, and sing the “here and now.” It
 ’s playful\, freeing\, and deeply connecting—an imperfect\, vibrant ex
 perience of belonging through sound. 118 Elliot 118 Elliot 118 Elliot St B
 rattleboro \, Vermont 05301 917-239-8743 118Elliot@gmail.com https://118el
